{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Reading %!error.callback% outside an error handler scope: %!error% itself is\nnull (no AsyncLocal-flowed error in this context), so the callback path is\nunresolved. Coder flipped the default from \"throws\" to \"null\" — simpler\nruntime contract, matches how %!error.X% works generally outside scope.",
